## 9. Error Reporting

### 9.1 What Happens When Something Breaks
If PaperRepair encounters an error:

```
Error Occurs
    ↓
Error caught by error handler
    ↓
Error ID generated (anonymous)
    ↓
Stack trace recorded (code info only)
    ↓
Error logged (no file content)
    ↓
Error report sent to our servers
    ↓
Developers review for fixes
    ↓
Error deleted after 90 days
```

### 9.2 What's in an Error Report
✅ Error message
✅ Stack trace
✅ Timestamp
✅ Browser version
✅ Page where error occurred

❌ Your file content
❌ Your personal data
❌ Your IP address (anonymized)

